{"name": "Gravity Grove", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-hidden=\"true\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"238\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239290/extras/d46cacd898e3fca953a0e56b922ba32e.poster.avif?t=1786391188\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239290/extras/d46cacd898e3fca953a0e56b922ba32e.webm?t=1786391188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239290/extras/d46cacd898e3fca953a0e56b922ba32e.mp4?t=1786391188\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rotate each level by stepping over its edges, shifting gravity in your favor to transform previous obstacles into new places to explore. Get ready for an incredible journey as you navigate the ever-changing terrain, guided by friendly forest spirits! These spirits will bestow you with amazing powers, ensuring you overcome every challenge with ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239290/extras/b20c5f572a56368624df7cc83eaa48af.poster.avif?t=1786391188\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239290/extras/b20c5f572a56368624df7cc83eaa48af.webm?t=1786391188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239290/extras/b20c5f572a56368624df7cc83eaa48af.mp4?t=1786391188\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-hidden=\"true\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"238\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239290/extras/0c8616fee7f5e4ad01df6097326d9b14.poster.avif?t=1786391188\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239290/extras/0c8616fee7f5e4ad01df6097326d9b14.webm?t=1786391188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239290/extras/0c8616fee7f5e4ad01df6097326d9b14.mp4?t=1786391188\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore at your own pace. Look for secret walls, hidden relics, and clues left by ancient travelers. These stories are waiting to be discovered, beautifully etched into stone monuments scattered throughout the grove.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239290/extras/d35eebafa855ccebbc1c07ca47bad2c5.poster.avif?t=1786391188\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239290/extras/d35eebafa855ccebbc1c07ca47bad2c5.webm?t=1786391188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239290/extras/d35eebafa855ccebbc1c07ca47bad2c5.mp4?t=1786391188\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-hidden=\"true\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"238\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239290/extras/8231b6a613a6fa7a303074e6c8e384d1.poster.avif?t=1786391188\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239290/extras/8231b6a613a6fa7a303074e6c8e384d1.webm?t=1786391188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239290/extras/8231b6a613a6fa7a303074e6c8e384d1.mp4?t=1786391188\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can design your own custom levels and experiment with different platforms and interactions. Then, upload your level to the Steam Workshop and share it with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239290/extras/5ea392cd69a9821e054bd556940b3197.poster.avif?t=1786391188\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239290/extras/5ea392cd69a9821e054bd556940b3197.webm?t=1786391188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239290/extras/5ea392cd69a9821e054bd556940b3197.mp4?t=1786391188\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Gravity Grove is a 2D platformer set on the faces of a 3D cube. Walk over the edges to rotate the entire level, shifting gravity in your favor to open up new paths and uncover hidden secrets from the past.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239290/1bbbe68f3b5a03bbc8af03a474d4630a87bc81a5/header.jpg?t=1786391188", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Platformer", "Puzzle", "Exploration", "Physics", "Casual", "Level Editor"], "developers": "Tapling Games", "publishers": "Tapling Games", "release_date": "Aug 10, 2026", "price": "$7.49", "appid": "4239290", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "10 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/bMITpmCEY3Q", "first_seen": 1786320000.0, "review_rank": 128}